status              device status
ver                 firmware version
clock               RTC time (UTC)
get                 show radio params
advert              send a flood advert
advert.zerohop      send a 0-hop advert
set name <v>        set node name
set freq <MHz>      set frequency
set bw <kHz>        set bandwidth
set sf <7-12>       set spreading factor
set cr <5-8>        set coding rate
set tx <dBm>        set TX power
wifi status|on|off|scan
wifi use <n> | set ssid <v> | set pwd <v> | apply | clear
mqtt status
